[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0696","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0696.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58096","title":"Linux kernel ath11k 无线驱动监视器模式缺失锁保护导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ath11k WiFi 驱动在 monitor 模式下调用 ath11k_hal_srng_* 系列函数时缺少 srng->lock 锁保护，导致共享的 srng 数据结构存在并发访问竞争条件。本地低权限攻击者可通过在受影响设备（如 WCN6855、QCN9074）上启用 monitor 模式触发该竞态，引发内核警告（RIP: ath11k_hal_srng_dst_peek）及系统崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 ath11k 驱动的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58096"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-16T15:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:37Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.14.2 及以上版本（或对应发行版内核：Ubuntu 25.04 更新至 linux-image-6.14.0-22-generic，RHEL/Debian 更新至各自稳定仓库最新内核）。如无法立即升级，可在加载 ath11k 驱动时禁用 monitor 模式（不启用无线监控功能）作为临时缓解措施。升级后需重启系统使新内核生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1d2178918efc928e11bed9631469ef79ff0a862a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/27ca8004ba93a0665faa6d477eaeb551e03de6c8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/63b7af49496d0e32f7a748b6af3361ec138b1bd3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b85758e76b6452740fc2a08ced6759af64c0d59a","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58096.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58096.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58096","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58096.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58096.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58096.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58096.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/04/GHSA-wgqx-9hcf-wpvq/GHSA-wgqx-9hcf-wpvq.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58096","https://github.com/newrelic/docs-website/blob/f561da7a110bdb148fc60a558cd7aef96382627c/src/content/docs/release-notes/docs-release-notes/docs-5-22-2026.mdx"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0696.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0695","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0695.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58095","title":"Linux JFS 文件系统只读检查缺失导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 JFS 文件系统在 extAlloc 和 extRecord 函数中调用 txBeginAnon 前缺少只读挂载检查，具有本地低权限的攻击者可通过对只读挂载的 JFS 文件系统执行写操作触发该漏洞，导致内核崩溃引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响各 Linux 发行版内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。各 Linux 发行版已发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58095"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-16T15:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:37Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含该补丁的版本：主线内核升级至 6.14 及以上版本；Ubuntu 25.04 用户升级至 linux-image-6.14.0-22-generic (6.14.0-22.22) 或更高版本，运行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade` 后重启系统。如无法立即升级，避免在只读挂载的 JFS 文件系统上执行写操作，或改用其他文件系统（如 ext4）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0176e69743ecc02961f2ae1ea42439cd2bf9ed58","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/15469c408af2d7a52fb186a92f2f091b0f13b1fb","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58095.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58095.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58095","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58095.md","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58095/CVE-2024-58095.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58095.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58095.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58095.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/04/GHSA-cxcw-75qj-r943/GHSA-cxcw-75qj-r943.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-58095"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0695.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0694","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0694.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58094","title":"Linux JFS 文件系统只读截断检查缺失漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 JFS 文件系统在 `jfs_truncate_nolock()` 函数中缺少对只读模式的检查，当文件系统以只读方式挂载时执行截断操作，会因日志指针（log）为空而触发空指针解引用，导致内核崩溃引发拒绝服务。本地低权限攻击者可通过挂载只读 JFS 文件系统并触发特定文件操作来利用此漏洞，影响使用 JFS 的 Linux 内核各发行版本。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58094"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-16T15:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:37Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至 6.14.2 或更高版本（含 6.15+），该漏洞已在提交 f605bc3e162f 和 b5799dd77054 中修复。Ubuntu 25.04 用户应安装 USN-7594-1 更新（linux-image-6.14.0-22-generic 6.14.0-22.22）。其他发行版请参照各自厂商公告更新内核包。如无法立即更新，可通过限制本地用户对 JFS 文件系统的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b5799dd77054c1ec49b0088b006c9908e256843b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f605bc3e162f5c6faa9bd3602ce496053d06a4bb","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58094.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58094.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58094","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58094.md","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58094/CVE-2024-58094.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58094.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58094.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58094.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/04/GHSA-p55c-m7rf-5552/GHSA-p55c-m7rf-5552.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-58094"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0694.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0693","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0693.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58093","title":"Linux 内核 PCI/ASPM 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 PCI/ASPM 子系统中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free，CWE-416）漏洞。在 PCIe 交换机上游端口的 multifunction 设备（MFD）场景中，当移除非 function 0 的设备时，ASPM 链路状态被过早释放，导致该链路仍作为下游端口的 parent_link 被引用，形成悬垂指针。攻击者可在具备本地低权限的条件下，通过热插拔操作以特定顺序移除设备触发该漏洞，造成系统崩溃（GPF）或潜在权限提升。该漏洞影响多个 Linux 内核版本（如 5.4.x、5.10.x 系列），CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58093"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-16T15:15:53Z","updated":"2026-07-16T12:16:43Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：主线 ≥ 6.5，或稳定分支 ≥ 5.4.292、5.10.236、5.15.180、6.1.134、6.3.13、6.4.4（对应各 LTS 分支）。如无法立即升级，可在 BIOS 层面禁用 ASPM（Active State Power Management）作为临时缓解措施，但可能影响 PCIe 设备功耗管理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a0f9aecf66b98959aab7fb5764b4b3e522f4f5b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4d96930239981f312821a4065db8cc0f8240a173","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/62db339ecc3d58d8fd83a9e4d80061cd943bb6e2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8b930ddc2044e36866c41423e89889e0258695a3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba4cdc14c0d4df00d3e99bff7fe545303db98183","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cbf937dcadfd571a434f8074d057b32cd14fbea5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd4b07507794f7ad1a74e12eca75121d98187e66","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e5cd58f61e9d8024ee11bd78c12c8916891d4077","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f556b6ba0ac5f8353287ce6ed761228f0b4fafb7","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58093.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58093.json","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/9add93bcdb185e06ac55bc2977f502ffdbdcd957/frontend/__mocks__/operatingSystemsMock.ts","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58093.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58093","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58093.md","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/ecc2bab56c5c47f4d721273dd01b82d8b6b78554/upstream-layers/yocto-docs/documentation/security-manual/vulnerabilities.rst","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58093.json","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58093/CVE-2024-58093.ql","https://github.com/RedHatProductSecurity/aegis-ai/blob/c75ea25fb0833dc4bfdb7429611cfa2af516c580/src/aegis_ai_ml/src/classifier/kernel-cve-impact-classifier/data/CVE-2024-58093/CVE-2024-58093.mbox"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0693.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0565","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0565.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56406","title":"Perl Perl tr运算符堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Perl 编程语言中的 `tr`（音译）运算符在处理左侧非 ASCII 字节时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 `tr` 运算符的左操作数包含非 ASCII 字节时，`S_do_trans_invmap` 函数中的目标指针 `d` 会发生越界写入，导致堆内存损坏。攻击者可通过构造特制的 Perl 脚本（如 `perl -e '$_ = \"\\x{FF}\" x 1000000; tr/\\xFF/\\x{100}/;'`）触发该漏洞，在缺乏足够内存安全防护的平台上可能导致拒绝服务或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Perl 5.34、5.36、5.38、5.40 及 5.33.1 至 5.41.10 的开发版本，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高。利用该漏洞需要本地执行恶意 Perl 脚本的能力，无需特殊权限或用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56406"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-13T14:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:08Z","remediation":"升级 Perl 至修复版本：5.40.x 用户升级到 5.40.2，5.38.x 用户升级到 5.38.4，5.34.x 和 5.36.x 用户升级到对应发行版的最新安全补丁版本。如无法立即升级，可应用上游 commit 87f42aa0e0096e9a346c9672aa3a0bd3bef8c1dd 的补丁（https://github.com/Perl/perl5/commit/87f42aa0e0096e9a346c9672aa3a0bd3bef8c1dd.patch）手动修补源码后重新编译。Linux 发行版用户应通过系统包管理器安装安全更新（如 apt upgrade perl / yum update perl）。临时缓解措施：避免在 `tr` 运算符左侧使用非 ASCII 字节序列处理不可信输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Perl/perl5/commit/87f42aa0e0096e9a346c9672aa3a0bd3bef8c1dd.patch","https://metacpan.org/release/SHAY/perl-5.38.4/changes","https://metacpan.org/release/SHAY/perl-5.40.2/changes","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/13/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/13/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/13/5","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56406.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56406.json","https://github.com/manwar/theweeklychallenge/blob/b80269de5ec1a2920fe576a532db22fcedb45a71/content/blog/cve-2024-56406.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56406.json","https://github.com/ekala-project/corepkgs/blob/d42eedf53274274d7bb9666071a8eecaa3dae5a0/pkgs-many/perl/CVE-2024-56406.patch","https://github.com/Perl/perl5/blob/d0f7d8eef2afa1167f036c6ddfe1fca566f3e922/pod/perl5402delta.pod","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-56406","https://github.com/openbsd/src/blob/7df8bae8aea92b7558995237fccbbb695cae1615/gnu/usr.bin/perl/pod/perl5384delta.pod","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56406.json","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/326d1eb3c211c5432d4f6357a04093f6484ab9cc/archive/2025/2025-04-16.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0565.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0551","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0551.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52981","title":"Elastic Elasticsearch 堆栈溢出漏洞","description":"Elasticsearch 在处理 Well-Known Text（WKT）格式的字符串时存在堆栈溢出漏洞。当解析包含嵌套 GeometryCollection 对象的特制 WKT 字符串时，递归深度过大导致堆栈溢出，造成服务拒绝。该漏洞需要高权限才能利用，攻击者可通过向 Elasticsearch 发送构造的 WKT 查询触发此问题，影响 Elasticsearch 服务的可用性。Elasticsearch 官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52981"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-08T17:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:07:57Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Elasticsearch 至 7.17.24 或 8.15.1 及以上版本，官方已发布安全更新修复了 WKT 解析中嵌套 GeometryCollection 对象导致的栈溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层限制 WKT 输入字符串的递归深度，或通过反向代理/防火墙限制仅受信用户访问 Elasticsearch 的 HTTP API 端口（默认 9200），降低高权限攻击者触发漏洞的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://discuss.elastic.co/t/elasticsearch-7-17-24-and-8-15-1-security-update-esa-2024-37/376924","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52981.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52981.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-52981.json","https://github.com/trailofbits/publications/blob/68408ccfe7600935cea71dbf7b5c930f7ea3a8d0/README.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-52981","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52981.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/org.elasticsearch/elasticsearch/CVE-2024-52981.yml","https://github.com/IHTSDO/snowstorm/blob/a11bac7e98c045d8b40770eb705347fd8924ed1d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/sscarduzio/elasticsearch-readonlyrest-plugin/blob/e9654904cf1ce638b081af4c5ef81522d6ca64cd/suppressions_cve.xml","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-52981.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0551.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0551.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0550","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0550.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52980","title":"Elastic Elasticsearch 不受控制的资源消耗漏洞","description":"Elasticsearch 的 PatternBank 类中的 innerForbidCircularReferences 函数存在不受控制的资源消耗漏洞（CWE-400）。具有 read_pipeline Elasticsearch 集群权限的恶意用户可通过构造特制的递归查询请求，触发深度递归调用，导致 Elasticsearch 节点因资源耗尽而崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Elasticsearch 多个版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等。建议用户升级至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52980"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-08T17:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:07:57Z","remediation":"升级 Elasticsearch 至 8.15.1 或更高版本。对于无法立即升级的环境，应从不可信用户的 Elasticsearch 集群角色中移除 read_pipeline 权限，阻止攻击者利用 PatternBank 类的递归缺陷触发节点崩溃。同时建议在集群层面配置线程池和断路器参数（如 circuit_breaker.request.limit），限制递归操作资源消耗。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://discuss.elastic.co/t/elasticsearch-8-15-1-security-update-esa-2024-34/376919","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52980.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52980.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-52980.json","https://github.com/trailofbits/publications/blob/68408ccfe7600935cea71dbf7b5c930f7ea3a8d0/README.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-52980","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52980.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/org.elasticsearch/elasticsearch/CVE-2024-52980.yml","https://github.com/sscarduzio/elasticsearch-readonlyrest-plugin/blob/e9654904cf1ce638b081af4c5ef81522d6ca64cd/suppressions_cve.xml","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-52980.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-52980.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0550.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0470","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11235","title":"PHP 请求关闭过程释放后重用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHP 8.3.19 之前版本及 8.4.5 之前版本中存在 Use-After-Free 漏洞，该漏洞源于 php_request_shutdown 过程中引用计数处理不当。当 __set 方法或 ??= 运算符与异常处理交织执行时，可触发已释放内存的重复使用。若攻击者能够控制内存布局并向目标 PHP 应用发送特制的恶意输入，则可利用该漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响大量使用受影响 PHP 版本构建的 Web 应用，CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重。建议用户升级至 PHP 8.3.19 或 8.4.5 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11235"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-04T18:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:57:21Z","remediation":"立即将 PHP 升级至 8.3.19 或 8.4.5 及以上版本。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.3.* < 8.3.19 和 8.4.* < 8.4.5，由异常处理器与 __set 或 ??= 运算符交互导致堆释放后使用（Use-After-Free），可被利用实现远程代码执行。PHP 8.2 及更早版本不受影响。如无法立即升级，应避免在 __set 方法中触发异常，或严格过滤用户可控输入以防止内存布局操控。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-rwp7-7vc6-8477","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2024/CVE-2024-11235.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11235.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-11235","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11235.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-11235.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-11235.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-11235.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-11235-reference-counting-in-php-request-s-1771409119000.md","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-11235","https://github.com/FreshTomato-Project/freshtomato-arm/blob/240e615c5db411a540cbeae405c9220098c680ae/release/src-rt-6.x.4708/router/php/NEWS"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0534","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48615","title":"libarchive bsdtar 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"libarchive 3.7.6 及之前版本中的 bsdtar 程序在处理 tar 格式文件的 PAX 扩展头部时，存在空指针解引用漏洞。具体位于 `archive_read_support_format_tar.c` 文件的 `header_pax_extension` 函数中，当解析特制的 PAX 扩展属性时，程序未对指针进行有效性检查便直接解引用，导致崩溃。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含恶意 PAX 扩展头部的 tar 文件触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证及用户交互，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48615"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-28T15:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:58:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 libarchive 至 3.7.7 及以上版本（最新稳定版为 3.8.8）。该漏洞存在于 3.7.6 及更早版本的 `header_pax_extension` 函数中，处理特制 PAX 头部时触发空指针解引用导致 bsdtar 崩溃。可通过 `apt upgrade libarchive`（Debian/Ubuntu）或 `yum update libarchive`（RHEL/CentOS）更新。如无法立即升级，避免使用 bsdtar 处理不可信的 tar 归档文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/88Sanghy88/crash-test","https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive/releases/download/v3.7.6/libarchive-3.7.6.tar.gz","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-48615.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48615.json","https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/blob/505f834d7881c25a6ae1c5eb24fe6c28d896543c/docs/changelogs/v25.4.6.67-stable.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-48615.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-48615","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-48615.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-48615.json","https://github.com/chef/chef-web-docs/blob/58e8a50d4a498854f2c6fb4e0fdf19307acacf48/content/release_notes/workstation.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-48615.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-57fm-4q7w-88cr/GHSA-57fm-4q7w-88cr.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0534.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0484","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0484.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12905","title":"tar-fs tar文件解压路径遍历与任意文件写入漏洞","description":"tar-fs 包中的 index.js 文件存在不安全的符号链接解析与路径遍历漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意的 tar 压缩包，在解压过程中利用符号链接跳转到目标目录之外，实现任意文件写入或覆盖。该漏洞影响 tar-fs 1.16.4 之前、2.1.2 之前以及 3.0.8 之前的多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。用户需升级至修复版本以防范此风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12905"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:00:44Z","remediation":"将 `tar-fs` 升级到修复版本：1.x 分支升级到 ≥1.16.4，2.x 分支升级到 ≥2.1.2，3.x 分支升级到 ≥3.0.8。如暂时无法升级，在解压不可信 tar 文件前对文件路径进行校验，拒绝包含 `../` 及符号链接指向目标目录之外的条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/mafintosh/tar-fs/commit/a1dd7e7c7f4b4a8bd2ab60f513baca573b44e2ed","https://www.seal.security/blog/a-link-to-the-past-uncovering-a-new-vulnerability-in-tar-fs","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/06/msg00012.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52268","https://github.com/theMcSam/CVE-2024-12905-PoC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12905.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-12905.json","https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/blob/943548a7b221d2e297ed3d9f9054801ff17b1fd5/cli/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/aaad87cd4808a501b9c27168b0278466591227b9/data/2024/CVE-2024-12905-theMcSam_CVE-2024-12905-PoC.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2024/CVE-2024-12905/exploit.py","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-12905.rules","https://github.com/vercel/vercel/blob/fabae940acf33ca050f0767d3d5dadc61fcffe32/packages/cli/src/commands/init/init.ts","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12905.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/tar-fs/CVE-2024-12905.yml","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/y/yarnpkg/yarnpkg.spec"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0484.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0707","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0707.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-7598","title":"Kubernetes 命名空间终止期间网络策略绕过漏洞","description":"Kubernetes 存在命名空间终止期间的竞争条件漏洞（CWE-362），当命名空间被删除时，对象删除顺序未定义，网络策略可能在受其保护的 Pod 之前被删除，导致恶意或已遭入侵的 Pod 能够绕过网络策略施加的访问限制。攻击者利用此时间窗口可实现对集群内其他 Pod 的未授权网络访问，造成机密性影响。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 3.1，危害等级低，攻击复杂度高，需相邻网络访问权限。建议升级至修复版本以消除竞争条件窗口。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-7598"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-20T17:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:20:31Z","remediation":"此漏洞暂无官方修复版本。缓解措施：1) 删除命名空间前，先手动删除该命名空间下的所有 Pod 及工作负载资源，确保网络策略在 Pod 之后被清理；2) 使用社区提供的 network-policy-finalizer 控制器（github.com/kubernetes-sigs/network-policy-finalizer）为网络策略添加 finalizer，防止其在所保护的 Pod 删除前被提前清理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/126587","https://groups.google.com/g/kubernetes-security-announce/c/67D7UFqiPRc","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/20/2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-7598.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2024/7xxx/CVE-2024-7598.json","https://github.com/kubernetes/community/blob/4363fcc207b36c73d17b2d0232bd494410208f86/sig-api-machinery/annual-report-2025.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-7598.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-7598","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2024/7xxx/CVE-2024-7598.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/k8s.io/kubernetes/cmd/kube-apiserver/CVE-2024-7598.yml","https://github.com/stackrox/k8s-cves/blob/7c6e98fff4e5c510beea5eb8764b9cc381660340/cves/CVE-2024-7598.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CVE-2024-7598-2025-05-31-1205","https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/lwkd/blob/c8bd4ff4e55396bde4b155c02e5c9a28420cf421/_posts/2025-03-23-update.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0707.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0708","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-7776","title":"ONNX onnx 任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"ONNX/ONNX 框架的 `download_model` 函数中存在路径遍历漏洞，由于对恶意 tar 文件中路径遍历攻击的防护不足，攻击者可通过构造特制的 tar 文件触发任意文件覆盖。未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需用户交互即可利用该漏洞，覆盖目标系统用户目录下的任意文件，在特定场景下可进一步导致远程命令执行。该漏洞影响 ONNX 1.16.1 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-7776"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-20T10:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:20:53Z","remediation":"立即将 ONNX 框架升级至 v1.16.2 或更高版本（v1.16.2 已修复 tar 包目录遍历问题，PR #6164）。如无法立即升级，在使用 download_model 函数前对下载的 tar 文件进行路径合法性校验，拒绝包含 ../ 等路径穿越内容的文件条目，并限制解压目标目录为专用临时目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://huntr.com/bounties/a7a46cf6-1fa0-454b-988c-62d222e83f63","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2024/7xxx/CVE-2024-7776.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-7776.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/onnx/CVE-2024-7776.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-7776","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2024/7xxx/CVE-2024-7776.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-7776.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/onnx/PYSEC-2025-10.yaml","https://github.com/yhy0/CHYing-agent/blob/0d2ee81fa783caf119cde1423e390552e32561c0/knowledge/raw/ghsa/path_traversal/GHSA-h36j-8vv3-cj52.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2025/03/GHSA-h36j-8vv3-cj52/GHSA-h36j-8vv3-cj52.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-7776"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0708.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0504","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-40635","title":"containerd 用户ID处理整数溢出漏洞","description":"containerd 容器运行时的用户 ID 处理存在整数溢出漏洞，当容器配置的 User 字段设置为超过 32 位有符号整数最大值（即 2147483647）的 UID:GID 时，整数溢出导致容器进程最终以 root 用户（UID 0）运行。该漏洞影响 containerd 1.6.38、1.7.27 及 2.0.4 之前的所有版本，可导致依赖非 root 用户运行容器的安全策略失效，产生意外提权风险。攻击者可通过加载特制镜像或调用相关 API 触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2024-40635"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-17T22:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:46:12Z","remediation":"立即将 containerd 升级至 1.6.38、1.7.27 或 2.0.4 及以上版本以修复整数溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，确保仅使用受信任的容器镜像，并限制非受信用户的镜像导入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/containerd/containerd/commit/05044ec0a9a75232cad458027ca83437aae3f4da","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/commit/1a43cb6a1035441f9aca8f5666a9b3ef9e70ab20","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/commit/cf158e884cfe4812a6c371b59e4ea9bc4c46e51a","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/security/advisories/GHSA-265r-hfxg-fhmg","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00005.html","https://github.com/yen5004/CVE-2024-40635_POC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-40635.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-40635.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/ad81b017c65b0fbc4ac39e9916807e69e5366a82/data/2024/CVE-2024-40635-yen5004_CVE-2024-40635_POC.md","https://github.com/ctrsploit/ctrsploit/blob/c7e0cebeec8ada5c08ff7abba44dcfc2ffceac9c/vul/cve-2024-40635/vul.go","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2024/CVE-2024-40635/README.md","https://github.com/containerd/containerd/blob/e05f673e2743e482e47128aeb8c5a87bde7ca612/docs/security/THREAT_MODEL.md","https://github.com/rancher/rancher/blob/78e5a036e183f6eee00a390ab87b8bc8a667a2a8/hack/airgap/go.mod","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2024-40635-2025-05-04-2105","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-40635.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-40635"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0504.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0709","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-8176","title":"libexpat expat XML实体递归扩展栈溢出漏洞","description":"libexpat XML解析库在处理XML文档中的递归实体扩展时存在栈溢出漏洞。当解析包含深度嵌套实体引用的特制XML文档时，libexpat会无限递归展开实体，耗尽栈空间导致程序崩溃。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标应用提交恶意XML数据触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务（DoS），在特定环境下可能进一步导致可利用的内存破坏。该漏洞影响libexpat 2.7.0之前的所有版本，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-8176"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-14T09:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:49Z","remediation":"升级 libexpat 至 2.7.0 或更高版本（该版本已将实体展开从递归改为迭代，彻底消除栈溢出风险）。对于无法立即升级的系统，可在 XML 解析入口处限制最大实体嵌套深度（如通过 XML_SetBillionLaughsAttackProtectionMaximumAmplification 设置放大因子上限），或在应用层对 XML 文档大小和实体引用链长度做前置校验拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:13681","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:22033","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:22034","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:22035","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:22607","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:22785","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-